  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Animals/BH_Realistic_Animals_header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">這個資源包改變了 Minecraft 中許多原版動物的外觀！具體來說，目前它改變了以下動物的外觀（未來還會有更多材質）：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 牛</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 羊</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 豬</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 雞</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 豹貓</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 狼</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 貓</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 熊貓</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 哞菇</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 駱駝</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 駱馬</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 海龜</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 馬</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a>（也支援 OptiFine）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">牛、羊、豬、雞、熊貓和哞菇的材質與模型設計者為 AviArt。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">豹貓、狼和貓的材質與模型設計者為 Matt_Hopes。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要伺服器來與朋友一起遊玩嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Animals/BH_Realistic_Animals_promo.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你正在尋找一個能與朋友一起玩任何模組或模組包的伺服器，<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong></span> 就是你的解決方案！他們提供最佳性價比的 Minecraft 伺服器，如果你點擊 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">這個連結</a></strong></span> 並使用優惠碼 \"Lupin\"，即可獲得 25% 折扣。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Animals/BH_Realistic_Animals_summary.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">這個資源包改變了社群中一些最受歡迎的原版動物的外觀，當然，現在它們看起來更加逼真有趣！但別擔心，它們仍會以原版友善的方式呈現，同時保留與預設材質的相似度。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Animals/BH_Realistic_Animals_faq.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>它能在伺服器上運作嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">當然！它完美運作！請記住，與朋友一起玩模組的最佳方式是透過 BisectHosting，而<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這個連結可獲得 25% 折扣</a></strong>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>這個資源包可以用在模組包中嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然！只要它僅在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上發布。上傳到其他任何平台都將侵犯我們的權利，且完全不被允許。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不過，如果你考慮將其加入你的 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 模組包，我們非常感激。如果需要任何小修改或有任何問題，請聯繫我們！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Animals/BH_Realistic_Animals_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/599/realistic-pig.png\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/600/realistic-cows-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/601/realistic-wolves-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/603/realistic-cats-7.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/604/realistic-ocelots-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">